@@ -19,7 +19,9 @@ bin/serve
 
 The moderator interface is at `/moderate`; every page there uses HTTP Basic authentication. Quizzes can be imported from the quiz list and exported from their individual pages. The readiness endpoint is `/up`.
 
-A quiz's **Start a game** action snapshots its active questions into a new game and opens the moderator's live screen. Players use the generated `/play/:code` link; their browser identity is kept in an encrypted cookie, and their player record and answers are isolated per game. Turbo Streams broadcasts run over the SQLite-backed Solid Cable adapter, with a reconnect snapshot fallback for unreliable networks. QR codes are generated locally.
+A quiz's **Start a game** action snapshots its active questions into a new game and opens the moderator's live screen. The per-question timer is also snapshotted; zero minutes and zero seconds disable it. A timed question uses its persisted opening time for the moderator countdown and closes automatically at the deadline. Timer settings are intentionally omitted from quiz exports.
+
+Players use the generated `/play/:code` link; their browser identity is kept in an encrypted cookie, and their player record and answers are isolated per game. Turbo Streams broadcasts run over the SQLite-backed Solid Cable adapter, with a reconnect snapshot fallback for unreliable networks. QR codes are generated locally.
 
